# VTID-03799 — commands run, in order

## Reproduction / diagnosis (read-only against staging telemetry)

# Live trace of the reported session (topic T005, staging, 2026-08-31).
# Read-only SELECT against oasis_events; no writes, no test content created.
SELECT type, status, message, payload, created_at
  FROM oasis_events
 WHERE created_at > now() - interval '2 hours'
   AND (payload->>'guided_topic_id' = 'T005' OR message ILIKE '%guided%')
 ORDER BY created_at;

